    "organization": null,
    "title": "Tooltip Scroll",
    "description": "The premier Fabric mod that allows you to move/scroll tooltips.",
    "body": "# Tooltip Scroll\n[![Image](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-green?style=flat-square)](https://github.com/Provismet/Tooltip-Scroll-Fabric/blob/1.20/LICENSE)\n![Image](https://img.shields.io/badge/environment-client-1976d2?style=flat-square)\n![Image](https://img.shields.io/badge/mod%20loader-fabric/quilt-d64541?style=flat-square)\n\n## Description\nTooltips are now scrollable. With highly-customisable keybinds and settings, you can move tooltips anywhere on or off the screen.\n\n### Movement\nUsing the mouse-wheel, keybinds, or even WASD, tooltips can be moved across the screen.\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wySVd6d8/images/cf465a9eb6687ac711a12956f06699c7b35719d8.gif\" alt=\"Tooltips can be moved anywhere on or off the screen.\">\n\n### Smoothness\nSetting a smoothness value lower than 1 will create a gliding visual effect.\n\n![](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wySVd6d8/images/d9c3744ff8f902b19858af87240ef21c37a4a986.gif)\n\n## Extras\nTo adjust the settings modmenu and cloth config are required.  \nAlternatively any setting can be adjusted in the `config/tooltipscroll.json` file in your Minecraft profile.",
